     A*                                     JUBADD - deliberately mis-typed
     A*                                     "staging" file for 05-11 (decimal
     A*                                     data error). Same field names/
     A*                                     lengths as db/v1/juchud.pf's
     A*                                     JUCHDR record EXCEPT JUSU, which
     A*                                     is 5A here instead of JUCHUD's
     A*                                     5S 0 - same total record length
     A*                                     (27 bytes) but a different type
     A*                                     for that one field.
     A*
     A*                                     Used by src/qclsrc/c0511s.clp with
     A*                                     CPYF FMTOPT(*NOCHK): FMTOPT(*NOCHK)
     A*                                     copies records between mismatched
     A*                                     formats without the normal field-
     A*                                     type check, so a row inserted here
     A*                                     with JUSU=blanks (valid for THIS
     A*                                     file's own 5A field) lands as
     A*                                     bytes with an invalid sign nibble
     A*                                     (X'40') in JUCHUD.JUSU once copied
     A*                                     across - simulating the *NOCHK-
     A*                                     caused corruption path the 05-11
     A*                                     syllabus entry names. FIXED
     A*                                     (2026-09-27, real hardware):
     A*                                     JUSU='ABCDE' was tried first, but
     A*                                     EBCDIC 'A'-'E' (X'C1'-X'C5') is
     A*                                     actually a VALID positive zoned-
     A*                                     decimal encoding of +12345 (digit
     A*                                     nibbles 1-5, sign nibble C) - it
     A*                                     raised no decimal-data error at
     A*                                     all (docs/probes.md). Blanks give
     A*                                     a genuinely invalid sign nibble.
     A          R JUCHDR                    TEXT('05-11 mis-typed staging')
     A            JUNO           6A         TEXT('Order number')
     A            JULINE         3S 0       TEXT('Line number')
     A            JUSHO          6A         TEXT('Product code')
     A            JUSU           5A         TEXT('Quantity (5A on purpose)')
     A            JUTNK          7S 2       TEXT('Unit price at order time')
     A          K JUNO
     A          K JULINE
